&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;注：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Chapter 3 | Serial Monogamy : A Memoir</title><link>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/book/i-feel-bad-about-my-neck/chapter-3/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:45:03 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/book/i-feel-bad-about-my-neck/chapter-3/</guid><description>第三章, 有点长&amp;hellip;</description></item><item><title>LeetCode 3331: Find Subtree Sizes After Changes</title><link>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/leetcode/LeetCode-3331:-Find-Subtree-Sizes-After-Changes/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:24:09 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/leetcode/LeetCode-3331:-Find-Subtree-Sizes-After-Changes/</guid><description>leetcode 3331 题题解</description></item><item><title>关于Dario Amodei于2003年抗议美国进行伊拉克战争的想法</title><link>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/essay/%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8EDario-Amodei%E4%BA%8E2003%E5%B9%B4%E6%8A%97%E8%AE%AE%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%BC%8A%E6%8B%89%E5%85%8B%E6%88%98%E4%BA%89%E7%9A%84%E6%83%B3%E6%B3%95/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 07:33:46 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/essay/%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8EDario-Amodei%E4%BA%8E2003%E5%B9%B4%E6%8A%97%E8%AE%AE%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%BC%8A%E6%8B%89%E5%85%8B%E6%88%98%E4%BA%89%E7%9A%84%E6%83%B3%E6%B3%95/</guid><description>Ahthropic 创始人Dario Amodei的人物志</description></item><item><title>Chapter 2 | I Hate My Purse</title><link>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/book/i-feel-bad-about-my-neck/chapter-2/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:36:44 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/book/i-feel-bad-about-my-neck/chapter-2/</guid><description>I feel bad abount my neck(我的脖子让我很不爽)， 是Nora Ephron写的一篇幽默散文集，里面讨论了她作为女性想的一些问题。每一章我单独写（水）一篇comment</description></item><item><title>Introduction</title><link>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/essay/introduce/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:46:58 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://CellMeet.github.io/posts/essay/introduce/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;作为一个刚入门编程的「greenhand」，写一些 blog 对个人成长是很有益的。如果能对他人有所帮助，那更是非常值得做的事情。编程大佬「左耳朵耗子」陈皓，平均每天输出 6000 字。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>友链</title><link>https://CellMeet.github.io/links/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://CellMeet.github.io/links/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>